{
  "id": "fastspeech-0001",
  "situation": "fastspeech",
  "sname": "早口・口語・縮約",
  "icon": "⚡",
  "level": 3,
  "title": "wanna / gonna / didja など実際の聞こえ方",
  "items": [
    {
      "en": "What do you wanna do?",
      "jp": "何したい？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "wanna = want to。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-001",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "I'm gonna send it tomorrow.",
      "jp": "明日送るつもり。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "gonna = going to。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-002",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "I gotta go. I've got a meeting.",
      "jp": "行かなきゃ。会議があるんだ。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "gotta = have got to。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-003",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Did you eat yet?",
      "jp": "もう食べた？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "didja / jeet などと聞こえる。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-004",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Whaddya think?",
      "jp": "どう思う？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "What do you think? の縮約。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-005",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "I dunno. Maybe.",
      "jp": "知らない。たぶんね。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "dunno = I don't know。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-006",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Lemme check.",
      "jp": "確認させて。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "lemme = let me。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-007",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Gimme a second.",
      "jp": "ちょっと待って。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "gimme = give me。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-008",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Kinda tired, but I'm okay.",
      "jp": "ちょっと疲れてるけど大丈夫。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "kinda = kind of。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-009",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "I coulda done it earlier.",
      "jp": "もっと早くできたのに。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "coulda = could have。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-010",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "You shoulda told me.",
      "jp": "言ってくれればよかったのに。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-011",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "I wouldn't've known.",
      "jp": "知らなかったと思う。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-012",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "D'you have a pen?",
      "jp": "ペン持ってる？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "D'you = Do you。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-013",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Howdja get here?",
      "jp": "どうやって来たの？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "How did you の縮約。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-014",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Whaddaya want for lunch?",
      "jp": "昼は何がいい？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-015",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "I'll call ya later.",
      "jp": "あとで電話するね。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "ya = you。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-016",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Got a minute?",
      "jp": "ちょっといい？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "Do you have が省略される。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-017",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Wanna grab a coffee?",
      "jp": "コーヒーでもどう？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-018",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Where're you from?",
      "jp": "どこの出身？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "Where're = Where are。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-019",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "What's he doin'?",
      "jp": "彼は何してるの？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "-ing の g が消える。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-020",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "It's a lot of work, innit?",
      "jp": "大変な仕事だよね？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "innit = isn't it（英国の口語）。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-021",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "I'm tryna finish this by five.",
      "jp": "5時までに終わらせようとしてるんだ。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "tryna = trying to。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-022",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-022.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Y'all are welcome to join.",
      "jp": "皆さん、ぜひ参加してください。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "y'all = you all（南部）。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-023",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-023.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "That's a good one, eh?",
      "jp": "いいね、でしょ？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "eh? はカナダで多い。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-024",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-024.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "I can't make it. I've got a thing.",
      "jp": "行けない。用事があって。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-025",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-025.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "I can't hear you. It's a bad line.",
      "jp": "聞こえません。電波が悪いです。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-026",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-026.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Okay, I'll text ya the address.",
      "jp": "了解、住所を送るね。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-027",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-027.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "What'd he say?",
      "jp": "彼は何て言った？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "What'd = What did。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-028",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-028.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Where'd you put it?",
      "jp": "どこに置いた？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-029",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-029.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Why'd you do that?",
      "jp": "なぜそうしたの？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-030",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-030.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Could you've told me?",
      "jp": "言えたんじゃない？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-031",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-031.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Right, so basically, what happened was, the guy didn't show up.",
      "jp": "つまり、要するに、その人が来なかったんだ。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-032",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-032.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Yeah, no, I totally get it.",
      "jp": "うん、いや、本当に分かるよ。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "Yeah, no は「いや大丈夫」の意味にもなる。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-033",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-033.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "I mean, like, it's not that bad, you know?",
      "jp": "いや、つまり、そこまで悪くないよ、ね？",
      "say": [],
      "note": "like / you know は間をつなぐ言葉。",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-034",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-034.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Um, so, I was thinking maybe we could, like, move it to Friday?",
      "jp": "えっと、金曜に動かせないかなって。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-035",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-035.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Honestly, I kinda wanna skip it.",
      "jp": "正直、ちょっと行くのをやめたい。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-036",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-036.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "It's not like I don't want to, it's just that I'm busy.",
      "jp": "したくないわけじゃなく、忙しいだけ。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-037",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-037.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Anyway, long story short, we're not going.",
      "jp": "とにかく、要するに行かないことにした。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-038",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-038.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Fair enough.",
      "jp": "なるほど、それはもっともだ。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-039",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-039.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Sounds good. Talk soon.",
      "jp": "いいね。またすぐ話そう。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-040",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-040.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Cool, cool. Appreciate it.",
      "jp": "オーケー。ありがとう。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-041",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-041.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Totally. No worries.",
      "jp": "もちろん。気にしないで。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-042",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-042.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Oh, for sure.",
      "jp": "ああ、もちろん。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-043",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-043.mp3"
    },
    {
      "en": "Bye now. Take care.",
      "jp": "じゃあね。気をつけて。",
      "say": [],
      "note": "",
      "id": "fastspeech-0001-044",
      "audio": "fastspeech-0001-044.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "app": "phrase-pack",
  "version": 1,
  "ver": 1
}